cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FieldRota-AI, please cite it as below."
title: "FieldRota-AI: a reinforcement-learning crop rotation planner that cuts groundwater pumping"
abstract: >-
  FieldRota-AI tells a farmer what to plant next, year by year until 2060, so the
  field pumps less groundwater. A tabular Q-learning agent, trained on NASA POWER
  weather and NASA NEX-GDDP-CMIP6 climate projections and constrained by Konya's
  2027 planting rules, is tested on years and climate models it never saw and
  compared with the exact optimum from dynamic programming. Entry to the Xylem
  Global Student Innovation Challenge 2026, High School Track, Challenge #1:
  Water Quantity.
